WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:01.585
Hello there, my friend!

2
00:00:01.585 --> 00:00:03.460
I'm Leo Lion.

3
00:00:03.460 --> 00:00:07.225
Today we learn about colors all around us!

4
00:00:08.346 --> 00:00:09.363
Are you ready?

5
00:00:09.363 --> 00:00:11.070
Let's find out together!

6
00:00:12.378 --> 00:00:13.105
Look!

7
00:00:13.105 --> 00:00:14.599
This is RED.

8
00:00:14.599 --> 00:00:18.196
Strawberries are red, and so are fire trucks!

9
00:00:19.706 --> 00:00:21.104
Which one is RED?

10
00:00:25.318 --> 00:00:30.115
Remember: Strawberries are red, and so are fire trucks!

11
00:00:31.438 --> 00:00:32.165
Look!

12
00:00:32.165 --> 00:00:33.583
This is BLUE.

13
00:00:33.583 --> 00:00:37.790
The sky is blue, and so is the big ocean!

14
00:00:39.294 --> 00:00:40.814
Can you say BLUE with me?

15
00:00:40.814 --> 00:00:41.957
Let's try!

16
00:00:46.178 --> 00:00:46.996
Wow!

17
00:00:46.996 --> 00:00:48.932
You learned so much today.

18
00:00:48.932 --> 00:00:50.777
I am so proud of you!

19
00:00:51.982 --> 00:00:53.608
Great job, my friend!

20
00:00:53.608 --> 00:00:56.063
Come back soon and we'll learn more.

21
00:00:56.063 --> 00:00:57.038
Bye bye!

22
00:00:58.042 --> 00:01:00.568
Try "Counting Together" next!
